    "title_vi": "Đứa con đầu lòng",
    "title_en": "When my first child was born",
    "text_vi": "Hồi con Lan mới sinh năm 1978, nhà còn nghèo, ông nhà đi làm mướn ngoài đồng. Nó ngoan lắm, bà để nó nằm võng rồi vừa ru vừa nấu cơm. Giờ nó ở thành phố mà tuần nào cũng gọi về hỏi má ăn cơm chưa.",
    "text_en": "When Lan was born in 1978 we were still poor, and my husband worked as a hired hand in the fields. She was such a good baby; I laid her in the hammock and sang lullabies while I cooked. Now she lives in the city, but every week she calls to ask whether Mother has eaten.",
